---
description: Testing standards
globs: **/tests/**,**/test_*.py
alwaysApply: false
---
- pytest, Arrange-Act-Assert, one behavior per test, named test_<unit>_<scenario>_<expected>.
- FastAPI TestClient with an isolated temp SQLite DB per fixture — never the dev database.
- Payment tests use the gateway test-mode sandbox/fixtures; never fake the money math itself.
- Stub external HTTP at the client boundary; no network, no sleeps — the suite must be deterministic.
